{# stock/content_engine/templates/index_screener.md.j2 #}
{% extends "_base.md.j2" %}
{% block body %}
<div class="hero">
  <p class="wordmark">CONDOR14 · QuantOptions Data Lab</p>
  <h1>Daily Iron Condor Volatility Screener</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Tracked live · Held to expiration</p>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.days_running }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">days tracking</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.setups_tracked }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">setups tracked</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat stat--progress">
      <div class="num">{{ hero.progress_label }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">{% if hero.cutover_reached %}leaderboard live{% else %}toward leaderboard unlock{% endif %}</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: {{ hero.progress_pct }}%"></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{{ ads_banner() }}

## Featured Ticker Deep Dives

{% if hot_cards %}
<div class="hot-grid">
{% for card in hot_cards %}
<div class="hot-card">
  <h3><a href="/{{ card.ticker|lower }}/">{{ card.ticker }} &middot; {{ card.company_name }}</a></h3>
  <p>{{ card.blurb }}</p>
</div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

[&rarr; How we build iron condor setups: read the guide](/guide/)

Live tracking initiated on **{{ site_launch_date.isoformat() }}**. Realized 30-day win-rate leaderboard unlocks once 200 settled setups accumulate (~44 trading days). Until then, the screener below shows today's setups ranked by premium structure and a per-sector volatility view.

## Top Realized P&L by Ticker

{% if top_realized %}
| Ticker | Realized P&L | Trades | Win Rate |
| :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
{% for r in top_realized %}| [{{ r.ticker }}](/{{ r.ticker|lower }}/) | ${{ "%.2f"|format(r.realized_pnl) }} | {{ r.trades }} | {{ "%.0f"|format(r.win_rate * 100) }}% |
{% endfor %}{% else %}
*No settled setups yet. Live tracking in progress.*
{% endif %}

## Today's Highest Premium Setups

{% if highest_premium_setups %}
| Ticker | Sector | Net Credit | Max Loss | Reward / Risk |
| :--- | :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
{% for s in highest_premium_setups %}| [{{ s.ticker }}](/{{ s.ticker|lower }}/) | {{ s.sector }} | ${{ "%.2f"|format(s.net_credit_at_open) }} | ${{ "%.2f"|format(s.max_loss) }} | {{ "%.2f"|format(s.net_credit_at_open / s.max_loss) }} |
{% endfor %}{% else %}
*No open setups for today. Check back after the next market close.*
{% endif %}

## Sector Volatility Heatmap

{% if sector_heatmap %}
| Sector | Avg IV Percentile | Open Setups |
| :--- | ---: | ---: |
{% for h in sector_heatmap %}| {{ h.sector }} | {{ h.avg_iv_percentile }} | {{ h.count_open }} |
{% endfor %}{% else %}
*No active sectors yet.*
{% endif %}

## Newest Tracked Setups (Today)

{% if newest_setups %}
{% for s in newest_setups %}- [{{ s.ticker }}](/{{ s.ticker|lower }}/) — opened at ${{ "%.2f"|format(s.underlying_at_open) }} ({{ s.trend_bias }})
{% endfor %}{% else %}
*No new setups initiated today.*
{% endif %}

## Methodology

Every setup is computed from real bid-ask quotes and tracked live to expiration. [Read the full methodology →](/methodology/)
{% endblock %}
